        "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r487257237-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html",
        "title": "Splendid Spiritual Bhole Baba's Adobe !",
        "text": "This place has amazing aura. The moment you step in or move around.There are several shiv-lings in complex each must be having it's own story.Carving's are breathtaking. There is big Nandiji as you enter the temple. Then there is a very long Trishul of bhole Baba !\n\nWord of caution stay away from pandit's approaching you fro puja .Instead near entrance there is State Bank of Nepal, here you can deposit money and get puja done at Jyotirling officially.  Different prayers start at 9:30am. If you go for official puja you will get more closer and longer darshan of Bole Baba ! There are different puja's available. \n\nJai Bhole !",
        "review_tip": null,
